 loads/2026/07/BVI-Fair-2026.png
UID:TAzgZHRQDtPDIVequyN33
SUMMARY:BVI Back to School Resource Fair 2026
DTSTAMP:20260806T110906Z
DTSTART:20260815T090000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us at The Lighthouse of Houston on August 15 from 9:00 AM 
	to 12:30 PM for our 2026 Transition and Resource Fair—a dynamic\, hands-on
	 event designed for blind and visually impaired youth ages 14–22. This exc
	iting fair empowers students with essential life skills including self-adv
	ocacy\, confidence building\, job readiness\, and computer literacy. Atten
	dees will explore adaptive technology\, orientation and mobility training\
	, and even get creative with accessible arts and crafts. The event also fe
	atures a wide range of community and government resources—all at no cost. 
	Plus\, students will receive free BVI accessible school supplies and a bac
	kpack! We are grateful to our amazing sponsors who help make this impactfu
	l event possible. \nStudents – Click here to register. \nVendors – Click h
	ere to register. \n \n\nhttps://houstonlighthouse.org/event/bvi-back-to-sc
	hool-resource-fair-2026/\n\nFrom Houston Lighthouse
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/bvi-back-to-school-resource-fair-20
	26/
LOCATION:The Lighthouse of Houston\, 3602 West Dallas\, Houston\, TX\, 7701
	9\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-lighthouse
CATEGORIES:Houston Lighthouse
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT4H
END:VEVENT
